<LanguageData>

  <!-- ===== Pipeline foundation (always run) ===== -->

  <!-- EN: base cost from tech level -->
  <UWU_BaseCostFromTechLevel.label>依科技等級的基礎成本</UWU_BaseCostFromTechLevel.label>
  <!-- EN: Provides a fallback base cost derived from the weapon's tech level. Ensures all weapons have a customization cost even if they lack a craftable recipe. Neolithic uses wood, medieval uses steel, industrial uses steel and components, and spacer and above use plasteel and advanced components -->
  <UWU_BaseCostFromTechLevel.description>提供依武器科技等級推算的備用基礎成本。即使武器沒有可製作的配方，也能確保它擁有自訂成本。原始部落使用木頭，中世紀使用鋼鐵，工業時代使用鋼鐵與零件，太空科技及以上使用塑鋼與高級零件。</UWU_BaseCostFromTechLevel.description>

  <!-- EN: base cost from recipe -->
  <UWU_BaseCostFromRecipe.label>依配方的基礎成本</UWU_BaseCostFromRecipe.label>
  <!-- EN: Replaces the tech-level fallback with the weapon's actual crafting recipe costs, including both fixed ingredients and stuff costs. Only acts when the weapon has a craftable base definition. -->
  <UWU_BaseCostFromRecipe.description>以武器實際的製作配方成本取代依科技等級推算的備用成本，其中同時包含固定材料與素材成本。只有在武器擁有可製作的基礎定義時才會生效。</UWU_BaseCostFromRecipe.description>

  <!-- EN: quality multiplier -->
  <UWU_QualityMultiplier.label>品質倍率</UWU_QualityMultiplier.label>
  <!-- EN: Scales costs based on weapon quality. Higher-quality weapons cost more to customize. Includes the base 50% cost fraction so each trait costs half the weapon's full recipe value before quality scaling. -->
  <UWU_QualityMultiplier.description>依武器品質調整成本。品質越高的武器，自訂成本越高。其中已包含50%的基礎成本比例，因此在品質調整之前，每項特質的成本是武器完整配方價值的一半。</UWU_QualityMultiplier.description>

  <!-- EN: rarity multiplier -->
  <UWU_RarityMultiplier.label>稀有度倍率</UWU_RarityMultiplier.label>
  <!-- EN: Scales costs by how rare the trait is. A trait that appears half as often as a common one costs twice as much to fit, and the increase is capped there. Negative traits are not scaled. -->
  <UWU_RarityMultiplier.description>依特質的稀有程度調整成本。出現頻率只有常見特質一半的特質，加裝成本會變成兩倍，增幅也到此為止。負面特質不受此調整。</UWU_RarityMultiplier.description>

  <!-- EN: negative trait material downgrade -->
  <UWU_NegativeDowngrade.label>負面特質材料降級</UWU_NegativeDowngrade.label>
  <!-- EN: Downgrades cost materials by one technology level for negative traits. Spacer components become industrial, plasteel becomes steel, steel becomes wood. Reflects that negative modifications use cruder, cheaper techniques. -->
  <UWU_NegativeDowngrade.description>將負面特質的成本材料降低一個科技等級。高級零件變成零件，塑鋼變成鋼鐵，鋼鐵變成木頭。這反映出負面改造使用的是更粗糙、更廉價的手法。</UWU_NegativeDowngrade.description>

  <!-- ===== Thematic rules (keyword-matched) ===== -->

  <!-- labelKeywords, whole-list injections: every English keyword is kept
       verbatim (those match the language-invariant defName tokens) and confirmed
       zh-Hant trait labels are appended. A zh-Hant label carries no ASCII space or
       hyphen, so it is a single token and a keyword can only match a trait whose
       ENTIRE label equals it; every token below is an exact label shipped by
       Unique Melee Weapons or vanilla Odyssey.
       Deliberately omitted: 握把 and 鑲嵌 (bare roots that match nothing - the
       vanilla labels are 定制握把 / 鑲金 / 鑲玉), 宙斯 / 單分子劍 / 等離子劍
       (weapon-name roots, no trait uses them alone), and 舒適 (extrapolated from
       the Comfort StatDef, no confirmed trait wording). UWU_EmpSplit needs none:
       vanilla zh-Hant writes EMP with ASCII spaces (EMP 子彈, EMP 脈衝器), so the
       English "emp" keyword already matches those labels token-for-token.
       UWU_HeavyScrap gets no injection at all: it sets requireAllKeywords, so
       appending anything would demand every entry at once and break the English
       heavy+scrap pair, and zh-Hant could never supply two space-delimited
       tokens anyway. -->

  <!-- EN: toxic component swap -->
  <UWU_ToxSwap.label>毒性零件替換</UWU_ToxSwap.label>
  <!-- EN: Replaces components with herbal medicine (3x the component count), reflecting the organic toxins needed. Weapons whose costs carry no components instead add herbal medicine scaled to the weapon's crafting complexity. -->
  <UWU_ToxSwap.description>將零件替換為草藥(數量為零件的3倍)，以反映所需的有機毒素。成本中不含零件的武器，則改為依武器的製作複雜度追加草藥。</UWU_ToxSwap.description>
  <!-- EN: tox, toxic, paralytic, acid-injector, venom, envenomed, poisoned, opiated, sedative -->
  <UWU_ToxSwap.labelKeywords>
    <li>tox</li>
    <li>toxic</li>
    <li>paralytic</li>
    <li>acid-injector</li>
    <li>venom</li>
    <li>envenomed</li>
