  <!-- EN: EMP value split -->
  <UWU_EmpSplit.label>EMP 價值拆分</UWU_EmpSplit.label>
  <!-- EN: Removes spacer components, then converts 70% of base material costs into industrial components by market value, representing the electronic parts needed for EMP modifications. -->
  <UWU_EmpSplit.description>先移除高級零件，再依市場價值將70%的基礎材料成本轉換為零件，代表 EMP 改造所需的電子部件。</UWU_EmpSplit.description>

  <!-- EN: lightweight swap -->
  <UWU_Lightweight.label>輕巧替換</UWU_Lightweight.label>
  <!-- EN: Replaces 40% of wood costs with birdskin, representing the featherwork used to lighten wooden weapons. Weapons with no wood in their costs are unaffected. -->
  <UWU_Lightweight.description>將40%的木頭成本替換為鳥皮，代表為木製武器減重所用的羽毛工藝。成本中不含木頭的武器不受影響。</UWU_Lightweight.description>
  <!-- EN: lightweight, whisper -->
  <UWU_Lightweight.labelKeywords>
    <li>lightweight</li>
    <li>whisper</li>
    <li>輕巧</li>
  </UWU_Lightweight.labelKeywords>

  <!-- EN: flarestriker value split -->
  <UWU_Flarestriker.label>閃焰彈價值拆分</UWU_Flarestriker.label>
  <!-- EN: Converts 70% of base material costs into bioferrite by market value, reflecting the exotic fuel source needed for flare launchers. -->
  <UWU_Flarestriker.description>依市場價值將70%的基礎材料成本轉換為生化鐵氧體，以反映閃焰彈發射器所需的特殊燃料來源。</UWU_Flarestriker.description>
  <!-- EN: flare, flarestriker -->
  <UWU_Flarestriker.labelKeywords>
    <li>flare</li>
    <li>flarestriker</li>
    <li>閃焰彈</li>
  </UWU_Flarestriker.labelKeywords>

  <!-- EN: heavy scrap flat cost -->
  <UWU_HeavyScrap.label>重型廢料固定成本</UWU_HeavyScrap.label>
  <!-- EN: Replaces all costs with a single steel slag chunk. Scrap modifications are crude and cheap — just bolt on some junk. -->
  <UWU_HeavyScrap.description>將全部成本替換為一塊金屬碎片。廢料改造既粗糙又廉價，不過是拿螺栓鎖上一些破銅爛鐵罷了。</UWU_HeavyScrap.description>

  <!-- EN: charge weapons (category-gated) -->
  <UWU_ChargeCategoryGated.label>電能武器(限定類別)</UWU_ChargeCategoryGated.label>
  <!-- EN: Converts all costs into advanced components by market value for charge-type weapon traits, representing the spacer technology required for pulse and beam modifications. -->
  <UWU_ChargeCategoryGated.description>對於電能類的武器特質，依市場價值將全部成本轉換為高級零件，代表脈衝與光束改造所需的太空科技。</UWU_ChargeCategoryGated.description>

  <!-- EN: charge weapons (unconditional) -->
  <UWU_ChargeUnconditional.label>電能武器(無條件)</UWU_ChargeUnconditional.label>
  <!-- EN: Converts all costs into advanced components by market value for traits involving advanced spacer technology, regardless of weapon category. -->
  <UWU_ChargeUnconditional.description>對於涉及高階太空科技的特質，無論武器屬於哪個類別，都依市場價值將全部成本轉換為高級零件。</UWU_ChargeUnconditional.description>
