  <!-- EN: blood hemogen surcharge -->
  <UWU_Blood.label>血原包附加成本</UWU_Blood.label>
  <!-- EN: Adds 10 hemogen packs on top of the computed cost for blood-themed traits. The hemogen is consumed for good: removing the trait refunds none of it. Without Biotech this rule does nothing. -->
  <UWU_Blood.description>為血液主題的特質，在計算出的成本之外追加10個血原包。血原會被徹底消耗：移除該特質不會返還其中任何一個。沒有「生機」DLC時，此規則不會有任何作用。</UWU_Blood.description>
